  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marketing of clean cookstoves</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grean World is an Ethiopian renewable energy company established in 2016. The company specialises in the manufacturing and distribution of ethanol stoves and fuel, mirt stoves and solar energy products.The &apos;Marketing of clean cookstoves&apos; project, under the SDG7 Results facility, focuses solely on the expansion of mirt stoves into the rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The company plans to reach 120.000 households within four years.</narrative>
  </description>
